.TH NN-OPTIMIZE 1 "2026" "nn 0.1.0" "NN Manual"
.SH NAME
nn-optimize \- safe graph optimizations
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B nn optimize [options] <input>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Identity/Dropout rewiring, dead-node elimination, and simple constant folding.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-o, \-\-output FILE
Write optimized model.
.TP
.B \-\-dry\-run
Show proposed changes only.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 success.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
nn optimize model.onnx --dry-run
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
nn-extract(1), nn-canonicalize(1)
